    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1 — Outbound Dispatcher & Schema Engine\n\n**Flow:** schedule → config/preflight → Airtable schema check & auto-create → fetch eligible leads → build the capped, staggered queue → per lead: wait → **re-read** → guard → verify → switch by touch → send → commit.\n\n**Two safety guarantees**\n1. `filterByFormula` never even loads a `Replied` / `Do Not Contact` / `Invalid` record.\n2. Every lead is re-read from Airtable *immediately before* its send, so a reply that arrives during the 15-20 min stagger still cancels the email.\n\n**Do not edit Code nodes here.** They are generated from `src/` by `npm run build`.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 1180,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "Note 16",
      "name": "Note 16",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Daily cap\n30/day, enforced in **Build Send Queue** — after dedupe, before the loop. Follow-ups are sent before new leads, so a backlog never starves live threads. Overflow rolls to the next business day.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "Note 17",
      "name": "Note 17",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1740,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Failure policy\n`Send via Postmark` and `Commit to Airtable` continue on error.\n\n- **Send failed** → `Last Error` written, **Status unchanged** → retried next run.\n- **Verifier down** → lead deferred, **Status unchanged**. An outage never burns a lead.\n- **Verified Invalid/Risky** → `Status = Invalid`, lead halted.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 3
      },
